    "previous_model_response": "Since \\(AB=5\\text{ m}\\) and \\(AC=7\\text{ m}\\),\n\n\\[\nBC=7-5=2\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\nUsing the right-angled triangles:\n\n- For \\(FE\\): the vertical height is \\(5\\text{ m}\\), and the horizontal distance is \\(2\\text{ m}\\), so\n\n\\[\nx=\\sqrt{5^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{29}\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\n- For \\(CD\\): the horizontal distance is \\(3+2=5\\text{ m}\\), and the vertical distance is \\(2\\text{ m}\\), so\n\n\\[\ny=\\sqrt{5^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{29}\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\nThus, the total perimeter is\n\n\\[\n1+x+2+y+2+5\n=10+2\\sqrt{29}\n\\approx 20.7703\\text{ m}.\n\\]\n\nThe cost is therefore\n\n\\[\n20.7703\\times £37 \\approx \\boxed{£768.50}.\n\\]",
